#: include/global_settings.php:738
msgid ""
"Controls how the Content-Security-Policy restricts inline JavaScript.  HTMX "
"keeps the 'unsafe-inline' policy that all current themes and plugins rely on "
"and matches the behaviour of prior releases.  Nonce Migration emits a strict "
"nonce policy in report-only mode so incompatible core and plugin scripts can "
"be identified without breaking the UI.  Nonce Enforcement blocks scripts "
"without the request nonce and requires CACTI_CSP_NONCE_ENFORCE to be true in "
"include/config.php; without that explicit gate it safely remains in report-"
"only mode.  None also permits unsafe eval() calls and is the least "
"restrictive option."
